&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;Full-Time&lt;/strong&gt; Role (40 hours per week, 5DWW) with no option for part-time work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This job ad is for Amsterdam, NLD. While this is a remote-first opportunity, the candidate filling this role must hold work authorization to work in the Netherlands without any time limitations or any other restrictions, and they &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;must be a resident&lt;/span&gt; of the Netherlands at the start of employment. Additionally, they &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;must be within commuting distance&lt;/span&gt; of our office in Amsterdam. This role is &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;not&lt;/span&gt; eligible&amp;nbsp;to be remote from other countries in Europe. If you wish to be based in one of our other locations listed for this role, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://boards.greenhouse.io/blab&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;our Careers page&lt;/a&gt; and submit your application through the job ad that best fits with where you hold residency and work authorization.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
